//! Inductive physical-Store invariants for the production Rover world.
//!
//! Bytes are related to logical documents by their production encoder
//! history.  This is deliberately stronger than merely saying that serde
//! happened to accept the bytes, and deliberately does not claim a decode
//! theorem without the two explicit codec boundary predicates in
//! `rover_refinement`.

#![cfg_attr(not(verus_keep_ghost), allow(unused_imports, dead_code))]

